WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
In September 1888, the Football
League began its first season.

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.930
All 12 of its clubs came from the
Midlands and the North of England.

3
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:13.910
Two of them, Aston Villa and Everton,
play in the Premier League in the 2026 to

4
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.790
27 season.

5
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.670
Now 6 of the 20 Premier
League clubs are in London.

6
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.170
Did London clubs buy their places?

7
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.170
Did someone move clubs south?

8
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.470
So what changed?

9
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.230
In this mission, you'll
map spheres of influence,

10
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.670
from a doorstep park
to a national stadium.

11
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.390
Then you'll follow the Premier
League's reach on screen,

12
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:39.710
into 878 million homes in 2019 to 20.

13
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.690
Your mission: explain how
the league's map changed,

14
00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:45.560
and why a stadium's location matters.
